#nexus

[Pairwise F_ST among 14 populations of the snow sheep (Ovis nivicola), Table S1 of
 Dotsev et al. 2026, Ecology and Evolution 16:e74182 (CC BY), with the colours of the paper as display labels.
 Figure 3 of the RazorNet paper shows this matrix as a Neighbor-Net and as a RazorNet with the Shave filter.]

BEGIN TAXA;
DIMENSIONS ntax=14;
TAXLABELS
